abstract: >-
  Replication artifact for a Defects4J 3.0.1 / Major 3.0.1 study of
  mutant–real-fault coupling with an ordinary-test reference arm.
  The primary estimand is bug-level excess unique-kill rate in the NO_GAIN
  stratum (n=288). Canonical kill maps are distributed as a GitHub Release
  asset. No DOI is assigned yet.
